// store through a pointer parameter the function reassigned, and a call result or a ternary handing the slot: `rrti_chain`'s reroot branch and
// `record_refs_into_pointer_value`'s depth walks pass `thru` (R34u's argument, in R1-4's `reroot_closure` loop and `k` loop), and
// `record_mut_of_call` walks the slot through first (R3-4). THE FACES (65): each a freed read on main (aefae6e) on every road 0-8, -O0 and -O2, and
// 97 under the detector, refused here at its own site. Their controls are in reassigned_slot_root_a_ok.npk.
